{{#> layout
    subject=subject
    preheader=(concat "Reconnect " bankName " before " consentEndsOn " to keep it syncing.")
}}
  <h1>Your {{bankName}} connection needs renewing</h1>
  <p>The access you gave Tempo to {{bankName}} ends on {{consentEndsOn}}. After that, Tempo can no longer sync this bank.</p>
  <p>Reconnect the bank in Tempo before then to keep your data up to date.</p>
  {{> button
      url=bankConnectionsUrl
      text="Reconnect bank"
      bgColor="#8F4032"
      textColor="#F6F1E8"
  }}
  <p>You get this email at most twice for each consent period: a week before the access ends and on the last day.</p>
{{/layout}}
